---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import TeamBuilder from '../../../components/TeamBuilder';
import { featuredPokemonIds } from '../../../config/seo-pages';
import { pokemonById } from '../../../data/pokemon';
import { pokemonGuides } from '../../../data/guides';
import { analyzeTeam } from '../../../lib/scoring';
export function getStaticPaths() { return featuredPokemonIds.map(slug => ({ params: {slug}, props: {pokemon: pokemonById.get(slug)!} })); }
const { pokemon: p } = Astro.props;
const guide = pokemonGuides[p.id];
const alternative = pokemonById.get(guide.alternative)!;
const analysis = analyzeTeam([p]);
const weak = analysis.defense.filter(row => row.weak.length);
const resist = analysis.defense.filter(row => row.resist.length);
---
<BaseLayout title={`${p.name} Team Builder, Weaknesses & Stats | Super Pokémon Team Builder`} description={`Build around ${p.name}, a ${p.types.join('/')} Pokémon. Review base stats, type weaknesses and computed teammate suggestions.`}><SiteHeader/><main id="main"><p class="eyebrow">POKÉDEX #{String(p.number).padStart(3, '0')} · GENERATION {p.generation}</p><h1>{p.name} Team Builder</h1><p class="intro">Start with {p.name}, then find teammates that complement its {p.types.join(' / ')} typing.</p><TeamBuilder initialPokemon={p.id} client:load/><section class="seo-content"><h2>How to build around {p.name}</h2><p><strong>{guide.role}.</strong> {guide.plan}</p><h3>Starter moveset</h3><p class="guide-scope">Generation 9 mechanics · casual singles example · base form. This is an editorial starting point, not a ranked-format recommendation or a legality check. Moves, items and abilities below do not change the builder score.</p><dl class="guide-loadout"><div><dt>Item</dt><dd>{guide.item}</dd></div><div><dt>Ability</dt><dd>{guide.ability}</dd></div><div><dt>Nature</dt><dd>{guide.nature}</dd></div><div><dt>Moves</dt><dd>{guide.moves.join(' · ')}</dd></div></dl><h3>Watch out for</h3><p>{guide.caution}</p><h3>What your teammates should do</h3><p>{guide.partners}</p><p>The suggestions tool compares typing and base stats. Check moves, abilities and your game’s rules separately before choosing a final team.</p><h3>An alternative to consider</h3><p><strong>{alternative.name}:</strong> {guide.alternativeReason}</p><a href={`/?team=${alternative.id}`}>Try {alternative.name} in the builder →</a><h2>{p.name} at a glance</h2><p>{p.name} is a {p.types.join(' / ')} base species introduced in Generation {p.generation}. The tool above starts with it in the first slot and recalculates as you add teammates.</p><div class="stats-grid">{Object.entries(p.stats).map(([name,value]) => <div><span>{({hp:'HP',atk:'Attack',def:'Defense',spa:'Sp. Attack',spd:'Sp. Defense',spe:'Speed'} as Record<string,string>)[name]}</span><strong>{value}</strong></div>)}</div><h3>Type weaknesses</h3><p>{weak.map(row => `${row.type} (${row.multipliers[0]}×)`).join(', ')}.</p><h3>Type resistances and immunities</h3><p>{resist.map(row => `${row.type} (${row.multipliers[0]}×)`).join(', ')}. These matchups depend on typing only; abilities and battle effects are excluded.</p><a href={`/pokemon/${p.id}/best-teammates`}>Explore computed {p.name} teammate suggestions →</a><h3>Further reading &amp; sources</h3><p>Our starter example is written for this guide. Pokémon Showdown’s Generation 9 data supplies the mechanics reference; Smogon analyses are separate, format-specific advice.</p><ul><li><a href={`https://www.smogon.com/dex/sv/pokemon/${p.id}/`}>Smogon: {p.name} strategy and format-specific sets</a></li><li><a href={`https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/${p.id}`}>Pokémon Database: {p.name} moves, evolution and game information</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/smogon/pokemon-showdown/tree/master/data">Pokémon Showdown mechanics data</a></li></ul><p>Guide reviewed October 5, 2026. <a href={`/feedback?from=/pokemon/${p.id}`}>Suggest a correction</a>.</p></section></main><SiteFooter/></BaseLayout>

<style>.guide-loadout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.guide-loadout>div{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px}.guide-loadout>div:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}dt{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}dd{margin:4px 0 0;font-weight:600}.guide-scope{font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:600px){.guide-loadout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.guide-loadout>div:last-child{grid-column:auto}}</style>
